@startuml
!include style.puml
skinparam ArrowFontStyle plain
title Viewing contact details: successful execution

participant ":MainWindow" as MainWindow UI_COLOR
participant ":LogicManager" as LogicManager LOGIC_COLOR
participant ":ViewCommand" as ViewCommand LOGIC_COLOR
participant ":Model" as Model MODEL_COLOR
participant ":ContactDetailsWindows" as Popups UI_COLOR
participant ":ContactDetailsWindow" as DetailsWindow UI_COLOR

MainWindow -> LogicManager : execute("view 1")
activate LogicManager
ref over LogicManager, ViewCommand
AddressBookParser and ViewCommandParser
parse the displayed index and create ViewCommand.
end ref

LogicManager -> ViewCommand : execute(model)
activate ViewCommand
ViewCommand -> Model : getFilteredPersonList()
activate Model
Model --> ViewCommand : displayedPersons
deactivate Model
note over ViewCommand, Model
Assume a nonempty displayed list and a valid index.
Filtering and sorting determine the selected contact.
end note
ViewCommand --> LogicManager : result: CommandResult(feedback, person)
deactivate ViewCommand

LogicManager -> ViewCommand : requiresStorageSave()
activate ViewCommand
ViewCommand --> LogicManager : false
deactivate ViewCommand
note over LogicManager
Read-only viewing skips the JSON save.
The existing contact file remains unchanged.
end note
LogicManager --> MainWindow : result
deactivate LogicManager

note over MainWindow
Show the short feedback in ResultDisplay.
end note
MainWindow -> Popups : show(person)
activate Popups
note over Popups
Reuse the popup that shows the same contact,
or open a new one.
end note
Popups -> DetailsWindow : showDetails(person)
activate DetailsWindow
note over DetailsWindow
Show a snapshot. Later model changes
do not update this snapshot.
end note
DetailsWindow --> Popups
deactivate DetailsWindow
Popups --> MainWindow
deactivate Popups
@enduml
